== Earlier sky130 attempts (stage-by-stage, why they were abandoned) ==
- unreg (pre-SRAM_OUT_REG netlist, 3.56 x 3.36 mm, 50 ns): placed (repair_design only):
  14.65 MHz, VRF dout1 (falling edge) -> D$ half_q; global route did not converge
  (FastRoute 72 extra iterations, ~2 h, killed). PLACE_DENSITY 0.6.
- reg, 3.56 x 3.36 mm: post-place 30.8 MHz (crypto ec_field mm->result 32.4 ns);
  CTS repair reached WNS -0.143 ns at 25 ns, then post-repair legalization failed
  (DPL-0033, ~100 cells, register-file cluster); same with 2-site padding (place),
  diamond legalizer (place) and a buffer-free repair (CTS, WNS -0.344). GPL reported
  "target density 0.5 too low for the available free area, adjusting to 0.83" (0.90
  timing-driven) -> die enlarged to 3.8 x 3.6 mm (reg2: GPL target 0.58).
- caravel (2.92 x 3.52 mm): post-place 25.8 MHz, post-CTS WNS -6.1 ns at 25 ns,
  post-GRT 32.2 MHz; FastRoute (20 % derate) 96 extra iterations without converging;
  -allow_congestion -> DRT-0218 "guide is not connected" twice (also without GRT
  antenna repair) -> caravel2: 0 % derate and met4 straps at 108.56 um.
